{
  "id": "cpp-4-13",
  "title": {
    "zh": "範圍內平方",
    "en": "Squares in range"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "<p>讀入 A、B，對每個 i（A ≤ i ≤ B）輸出一行 <code>i*i=結果</code>（格式如 <code>3*3=9</code>）。</p>",
    "en": "<p>Squares in range.</p>"
  },
  "hint": {
    "zh": "外層 <code>for</code> 從 A 到 B，每行 <code>cout &lt;&lt; i &lt;&lt; \"*\" &lt;&lt; i &lt;&lt; \"=\" &lt;&lt; (i*i) &lt;&lt; endl;</code>",
    "en": "Loop i from A to B; print <code>i*i=...</code> each line with <code>cout</code>."
  },
  "starterCode": "#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n",
  "tests": [
    {
      "input": "4\n5",
      "output": "4*4=16\n5*5=25"
    },
    {
      "input": "5\n8",
      "output": "5*5=25\n6*6=36\n7*7=49\n8*8=64"
    },
    {
      "input": "0\n3",
      "output": "0*0=0\n1*1=1\n2*2=4\n3*3=9"
    },
    {
      "input": "3\n7",
      "output": "3*3=9\n4*4=16\n5*5=25\n6*6=36\n7*7=49"
    },
    {
      "input": "10\n13",
      "output": "10*10=100\n11*11=121\n12*12=144\n13*13=169"
    },
    {
      "input": "20\n20",
      "output": "20*20=400"
    },
    {
      "input": "100\n104",
      "output": "100*100=10000\n101*101=10201\n102*102=10404\n103*103=10609\n104*104=10816"
    },
    {
      "input": "0\n10",
      "output": "0*0=0\n1*1=1\n2*2=4\n3*3=9\n4*4=16\n5*5=25\n6*6=36\n7*7=49\n8*8=64\n9*9=81\n10*10=100"
    }
  ],
  "source": "snakify.org/en/lessons/for_loop_range/problems/squares_in_range/"
}
